<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Nippon Steel Semicon cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Nippon Steel Semicon cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research Ltd downgraded Nippon Steel Semiconductor Corp to a &quot;C&quot; rating from its previous &quot;B&quot;, Daiwa Securities brokers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;C&quot; rating to issues whose values it expects to underperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
</text>
